&lt;p&gt;For the first months, you&#39;ll be part of the Sales Development Associate program, which is designed to accelerate your onboarding and ramp to full productivity as an SDR. This intensive program is built to help you quickly build and develop skills required to be successful in this role. Upon completion, you&#39;ll continue learning and growing in your career as part of Stripe&#39;s Sales Development Academy. These programs are endorsed and supported by sales leaders as an important part of in

