&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute scalable compensation programs and processes, including compensation and equity cycles, governance, timelines, and tools, in partnership with People, Finance, HRIS, Payroll, Legal, and business leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dynamic compensation models and scenario analyses to support budgeting, workforce planning, and compensation design for cash/equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;P

